<section class="massage-tips" id="massage-tips" style="background: url('{{ 'slide9_img0_29.png' | asset_url }}') center/cover no-repeat;">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section-title" style="color:#fff;">正确按摩，效果加倍</h2>
    <div class="tips-grid">
      <div class="tip-card">
        <div class="tip-number">01</div>
        <h3>按需调整频率</h3>
        <p>油性头皮可隔天使用一次，中性或干性头皮建议每周2-3次，维持头皮健康状态。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="tip-card">
        <div class="tip-number">02</div>
        <h3>强调指腹按摩</h3>
        <p>用指腹进行打圈按摩，而不是用指甲用力抓挠，能有效避免损伤头皮屏障。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="tip-card">
        <div class="tip-number">03</div>
        <h3>保证充足时长</h3>
        <p>每次按摩时间建议在3分钟以上，让产品有效成分充分渗透并被头皮吸收。</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
.massage-tips { padding: 100px 0; position: relative; }
.massage-tips::before {
  content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 0;
  background: rgba(0,0,0,0.55); z-index: 1;
}
.massage-tips .container { position: relative; z-index: 2; }
.tips-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
  gap: 28px;
  margin-top: 40px;
}
.tip-card {
  background: white;
  border-radius: 16px;
  padding: 36px 28px;
  text-align: center;
  box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
  transition: transform 0.3s;
}
.tip-card:hover { transform: translateY(-4px); }
.tip-number {
  width: 56px; height: 56px;
  margin: 0 auto 16px;
  background: #4a7c3f;
  border-radius: 50%;
  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
  color: white; font-size: var(--h3-size); font-weight: var(--fw-bold);
}
.tip-card h3 { font-size: 18px; color: var(--brand-dark); margin-bottom: 12px; }
.tip-card p { font-size: var(--body-small); color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.7; }
</style>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Massage Tips",
  "settings": [],
  "presets": [{ "name": "Massage Tips" }]
}
{% endschema %}
